			"notes": "- Prefer the mod's display name over its id in \"from mod\" attribution\n- Show aliases as `(+N)` with a hover in `/help` and as a full list in `/help <command...>`\n- Hide aliases from `/help` command list (don't show them as individual commands)\n- Fix arguments being ignored when using `/help` on an alias (`/help alias arg1 arg2 ...`)\n- Attribute mod when any description key exists for a command (before this it was necessary to have a description for the command itself, now having description for at least one argument for that command is enough for mod to get attribution)\n- Attribute `/help` to **Better /help**"
